{
  "issue": "holonomic-mobile-base",
  "human_owner": "Quchaosheng",
  "objective": "用相互连接的四模块转向驱动底盘替换视觉上固定的封闭底座，使其明确支持自主的前进、横向、对角与原地旋转运动，同时保留用于操作的可回缩稳定支腿。",
  "allowed_paths": [
    "hardware/mechanical/**",
    "tests/hardware/test_engineering_packages.py",
    "docs/assets/premium-product-render.html",
    "docs/assets/workbench-home-robot-premium.png",
    "docs/task_packets/holonomic-mobile-base.json"
  ],
  "read_only_paths": ["robot/**", "interfaces/**", "firmware/**", "hardware/pcb/**"],
  "forbidden": ["robot/control/**", "firmware/**", "services/**", "interfaces/**"],
  "acceptance": [
    "底座具有四个独立的转向驱动模块，带有可见且相连的车轮、转向叉、转向轴承与底盘承载路径。",
    "声明的运动模式包括纵向、横向、对角与原地旋转运动。",
    "稳定支腿在导航期间回缩，仅在静止操作时展开。",
    "SCAD、STEP、工程图、交互式渲染、宣传图、BOM 与装配顺序在全向底座上保持一致。",
    "自主导航软件与物理驱动验证保持显式的不完整状态。",
    "机械测试、Ruff 与任务包校验通过。"
  ],
  "commands": [
    "python hardware/mechanical/tools/generate_artifacts.py",
    "python -m pytest tests/hardware/test_engineering_packages.py::MechanicalPackageTests -q",
    "python -m ruff check hardware/mechanical tests/hardware/test_engineering_packages.py",
    "python tools/scripts/check_task_packet.py docs/task_packets/holonomic-mobile-base.json"
  ],
  "evidence": [
    "hardware/mechanical/design-spec.json",
    "hardware/mechanical/cad/desk_robot.scad",
    "hardware/mechanical/generated/parts/mobile_base.step",
    "hardware/mechanical/generated/desk_robot_assembly.step",
    "hardware/mechanical/generated/drawings/general-arrangement.svg",
    "docs/assets/premium-product-render.html",
    "docs/assets/workbench-home-robot-premium.png"
  ],
  "stop_conditions": [
    "底盘变更需要凭空捏造已完成的导航、电机控制、定位或安全性能。",
    "车轮模块无法保持受保护的转向硬件与相连的结构路径。",
    "底座将失去双臂操作所需的制动与稳定支腿要求。",
    "视觉效果将暗示并未发生过的物理驱动验证。"
  ]
}
